{"id": "DfB41G1yfX3", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Hum itne khush the ki shayad kisi se dekha nahi gaya… aur phir humein nazar lag gayi 🧿\n\nMonsoon ki raat, mahal ki khidki, aur uske sar ke upar ek neela nazar ka mohra, kaale dhaage pe… jo usse har buri nazar se bachata tha.\nMor ne apne sau aankhon wale pankh khole, bijli giri, aur woh mohra toot gaya.\nPhir dheere dheere har rang mein daraar padi… zehar ban kar, rooh tak.\nAakhir mein bas woh kaala dhaaga reh gaya… aur woh, jo ab bhi khidki pe intezaar kar rahi hai.\n\n🎵 Nazar Lagi · Akanksha Choudhary · Goldie Sohel · Asees Kaur · Noor @akankshachoudhary_official @goldiesohel @aseeskaurmusic \n\nUsko bhejo jiske pyaar ko kisi ki nazar lag gayi 🤍\n\nNazar Lagi | Rab jaane kiski nazar lagi | evil eye | sad love song | Asees Kaur | Goldie Sohel | Indian painting | peacock art | monsoon night | lyrics reel\n\n#NazarLagi #AseesKaur #akankshachoudhary #IndianArt #EvilEye", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1793172435, "like_count": 221, "comment_count": 2, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1815967639533152a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.928, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP8fZW1j0fYENEZoYYKFYcwjFRuEwxD2bJjP8jubCunX00OZc4fTVI67yUOa_D8-C6ySPmI0QP5LeR79_vg5IERrytDqJJW3u08KvE.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=Adqg6wjGDyhXoGfFkFi3QZAL8zq-31mSCR8OzswA3kseaeGiO9zD0MYqa7UuKwpAtBLuGAWZ49vvi6yJZmP5dDp4&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=dea-D_SLuCQQ7kNvwGLRTXD&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=A1fVuHF-LznAFIkLp8YZqA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRsQMdYrxUSg_Ztc-bj5vdshJ1p7Qm6g3Kv6S6Z1R52Yw&oe=6AF40E6C", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_